{"id":"211b9bdb37ae4f97","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-2random-char.md","title":"2 随机性的无穷多次最大前缀复杂度刻画","display":"thm-2random-char — 2 随机性的无穷多次最大前缀复杂度刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-2random-char","aliases":["43-thm-2random-char"],"display":"thm-2random-char — 2 随机性的无穷多次最大前缀复杂度刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-2random]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Bauwens, arXiv:1310.5230v1, 2013-10-19","source_location":"外部补充：Bruno Bauwens, Prefix and plain Kolmogorov complexity characterizations of 2-randomness: simple proofs, arXiv:1310.5230v1 (2013-10-19), Theorem 4, 印刷7/PDF7；https://arxiv.org/pdf/1310.5230","source_scope":"external-supplement","verification_status":"external-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false,"external_source_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1310.5230"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-2random-char"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-2random-char</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-2random-char — 2 随机性的无穷多次最大前缀复杂度刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6460737e81fabbf\" href=\"?note=c6460737e81fabbf\" title=\"43-df-2random\">43-df-2random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Bauwens, arXiv:1310.5230v1, 2013-10-19"},{"key":"source_location","html":"外部补充：Bruno Bauwens, Prefix and plain Kolmogorov complexity characterizations of 2-randomness: simple proofs, arXiv:1310.5230v1 (2013-10-19), Theorem 4, 印刷7/PDF7；<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1310.5230\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/1310.5230</a>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"external-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"external-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"external_source_url","html":"<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1310.5230\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/1310.5230</a>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_2\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c6460737e81fabbf\" href=\"?note=c6460737e81fabbf\" title=\"43-df-2random\">43-df-2random</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(n)\">\\(K(n)\\)</span> 使用固定可计算整数编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(n\\ge N\\land K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n+K(n)-c\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(n\\ge N\\land K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n+K(n)-c\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用户提供的2007草稿未定位此K双向刻画；后续一手论文Theorem 4给出等价的liminf[n+K(n)−K(X↾n)]有限刻画，已逐项比对。前缀复杂度一般上界保证该亏损有统一常数下界，因此liminf有限等价于存在固定c无穷多次达到n+K(n)−c。这是明确的书外补充，不冒充2007版本的定理。</p>\n<p>来源：外部补充：Bruno Bauwens, Prefix and plain Kolmogorov complexity characterizations of 2-randomness: simple proofs, arXiv:1310.5230v1 (2013-10-19), Theorem 4, 印刷7/PDF7；<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1310.5230\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/1310.5230</a>。本节点为书外补充或其本地推论；来源版本如上，未归入2007草稿的定理编号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-2random","status":"resolved","id":"c6460737e81fabbf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-2random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-2random","status":"resolved","id":"c6460737e81fabbf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_2$ 见 [[43-df-2random]]，$K$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]，$K(n)$ 使用固定可计算整数编码。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_2$ 见 [[43-df-2random]]，$K$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]，$K(n)$ 使用固定可计算整数编码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_2","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(n\\ge N\\land K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n+K(n)-c\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1849,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-513","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-2random-char]] — 2 随机性的无穷多次最大前缀复杂度刻画"}],"outgoing":["c6460737e81fabbf","6cd902d852c2c848"]}